name codesection
category Package
revision 34481
shortdesc Provides an environment that may be conditionally included
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides an environment to switch a section of
longdesc code on or off. The code may be placed anywhere in the file (it
longdesc is not limited to the document or the preamble). The motivation
longdesc for this package was to have commands which allow preselection
longdesc based on whether sections of code in a preamble of a template
longdesc are executed.
